{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42207","headline":"寒食成判官垂访因赠 · 徐铉","name":"寒食成判官垂访因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常年寒食在京华，今岁清明在海涯。\n远巷蹋歌深夜月，隔墙吹管数枝花。\n鸳鸾得路音尘阔，鸿雁分飞道里赊。\n不是多情成二十，断无人解访贫家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐铉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42207.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42207","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}